Synchronet BBS Compatibility Layer (anetbbs/games/sbbs_stubs/,
anetbbs/games/sbbs_reference/)
----------------------------------------------------------------------
ANetBBS can run door games and mods originally written in Synchronet's
JavaScript dialect (see docs/26-synchronet-json-rpc-doors.md and the
bundled LORD door). To do that without requiring a real Synchronet
installation, these two directories provide a compatibility layer:
some files are ANetBBS's own original code emulating Synchronet's
JS API, and others are Synchronet source itself, included so the
scripts that `load()` them keep working unmodified. sbbs_reference/
specifically holds a small set of real upstream Synchronet files kept
verbatim for developer reference; ANetBBS's own replacement
implementations (http.js, json-client.js, mouse_getkey.js,
dorkit/sbbs_input.js, etc., in sbbs_stubs/) are original code, not
copies of these.

